{"server":"cn","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_st01","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_st01","title":"浪潮守望者","storyCode":"BP-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"1dcd5402c98bdf155fe50086631bb85824196ccc0298c2237792a2696f45a3c6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿戈尔的城市“弥利亚留姆”主动与陆地取得联系，邀请伊比利亚派遣使节前往深海。为了解决海嗣问题，阿戈尔将开辟一条联通海洋与陆地的航道。与此同时，乌尔比安也出现在了附近的海域。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，他的路在身前♪\n父母与儿女都与他失散♪\n他的恋人已经葬身大海♪\n一个猎人他走上海岸♪\n他的家乡在后，徒余哀叹♪\n他的路没有尽头♪\n他的路浓雾弥漫♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个猎人他回到海岸♪\n他的旅程结束，他的家乡近在眼前♪\n旧日的涛声呢喃♪\n可他为什么却步♪\n又为什么不安♪"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好久不见，斯卡蒂。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好啊，斯卡蒂。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"按照约定，来接你的应该是那个脸皮很厚话又多的黎博利，但你好像并不惊讶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你和极境都是罗德岛的干员。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"毕竟这里更靠近你的故乡。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你比凯尔希估计的晚到了快一个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"看来就算有圣徒开具的公函，审判庭该有的审查程序还是一样没落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"才不到三个月，除了能派上用场的工人外，这里的居民全都迁去了内陆城镇，取而代之的是几个大阵的惩戒军。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们在紧锣密鼓地筹备着什么。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他们看起来非常紧张。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"自从一周前，伊比利亚收到了来自阿戈尔的联络，这座被遗忘的小镇就不再安静了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"遍地的海洋残渣刺激着这些年轻战士的神经，阿戈尔的声音只会加重他们的焦虑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿戈尔的行动确实值得关注甚至戒备。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"远海中的国家突然发声，没人能充耳不闻。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沿着雕塑左侧的这条街道过去，走得快一点，十分钟就能看到大海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们待会儿直接前往伊比利亚之眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你听见海浪了吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂微微侧过了头，迎向海风吹来的方向，她的长发在风中舞动，与眼中的阴翳同色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"浪的层次变得很复杂，我还听见了——星空流动的声音，永不停歇的自然的歌，还有，不被理解的语言......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Ishar-mla。\n我在。\n我们遭受的苦永在。\n我们渴望的生永在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斯卡蒂，你还好吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"和家乡恢复联系，反而让你心神不宁？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"近乡情怯吧......算了，这种感受很难总结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"也可能只是没睡好觉，上次回了一趟海里，好像鲨鱼把她的梦都转移给我了一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，凯尔希医生为什么这么着急地叫你过来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不记得你接触过海洋，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不一定，但我记不清了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"但似乎，并不陌生。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"这个回答很模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我忘了你的情况。这个回答其实很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，凯尔希医生把你叫过来，总有她的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，天快要黑下来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别靠过来，等我把水甩干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，医生。很少有人能锁定深海猎人的行踪。剑鱼提前告诉你我们要从这儿上岸吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"极境在这一片海域布置了信息采集装置，目前已经完成校准，与伊比利亚之眼的中控系统直接联通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么短的时间，架设一套针对水下环境的定位系统，那个黎博利还挺有能耐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该理解为，罗德岛与审判庭加深了合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一周前，水下的那座城市通过特殊频段告知伊比利亚，阿戈尔将开辟一条联通阿戈尔本境与陆地的“航道”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而面对这项庞大的计划，除了大灯塔的定位系统，伊比利亚几乎没有其他获取情报的途径。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显然，作为总战争设计师的您，对此也毫不知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，告诉凯尔希我们的发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我和队长第三次潜回斯图提斐拉沉没的地方，距离上一次，仅仅相隔了十天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次的时候，还能看见爆炸后残存的船体插在海床上，借着从海面透下的微光，舱体内部的金色像是晕开的颜料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这一次，巨大的金属船体结构已经完全消失，取而代之的是一片生机盎然的珊瑚丛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我习惯了做梦，但依然觉得不真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那块悼亡文明与历史的碑，只树立了极短的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“愚人号”已经彻底变成了海洋的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确说，化作了海嗣巢穴的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣同化环境的速度加快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但还有更值得关注的事情。我们的确发现了战争的痕迹，而且就发生在不久前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完全净空，连海雪也不见一丝的海域；扭曲破碎，明显被微型奇点撕扯过的海床......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能做到这些的，恐怕只有阿戈尔正规军团的舰队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一个常在陆地上行走的人，凯尔希，你对阿戈尔的关注与了解超乎寻常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然远隔无垠的海水，但阿戈尔依然属于泰拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和歌蕾蒂娅已经决定，前往那座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这无疑是一个冒险的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有一点冒险啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相当冒险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，深海猎人已经观察了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那次行动之前，我作为深海猎人总战争设计师参加了科学院与技术院的军事会议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在两院当时制定的战争预案里，并不存在一座靠近陆地的军事要塞，也不存在涉及“航道”的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问，阿戈尔经历了重大变故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斩杀伊莎玛拉之后，我们和本境的联系彻底断绝。根据已知的情报很难拼凑出真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不能构成你们重返阿戈尔的充足理由。最先劝阻你们的人甚至并不是我，而是你们旧日的同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......乌尔比安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔比安也一定明白，陆地上不会有答案。我们必须回到海洋之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果刻意与阿戈尔保持距离是他的策略，那我们就更有必要以正式的姿态回归阿戈尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......自我从睡梦中清醒以来，海浪时刻在诉说着，迷途的人该回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海猎人，必须返回故乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂娅，我会与你们同行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你而言，这的确是个不可多得的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我此行并不仅仅代表我自己，甚至不仅仅代表罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚？他们往你已经不堪重负的肩膀上多加了一副担子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这同样是我自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛与伊比利亚审判庭的合作刚刚起步，正如我们之间的合作也依然只是开始。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希凝视着歌蕾蒂娅，海风没有吹皱对方那张毫无表情的脸。\n短暂的沉默后，歌蕾蒂娅点了点头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，距离我们收到阿戈尔的联络已经有几天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八天了，圣徒阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这八天里，除了必要的布置、会议和休息时间，您一直站在这里观察着海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔一方并未给出明确的接洽时间，我理解您担心错过他们的动向，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，看看眼前的海。"},{"type":"narration","text":"难以辨明颜色的深沉海洋涌动着。或许是海面太过辽阔，天空便显得低沉。\n海水撞击礁石，激起几米高的浪涛，在这狭小的天地间激荡出轰然声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对伊比利亚来说，没有翻涌着恐鱼血肉的海洋，哪怕再喧嚣，也是仁慈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一位故友，曾是港都最富才情的诗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宏伟的港都沉入静谧之后，他挣扎着一路向北逃亡，踏着遍地饿殍来到了内陆深处，那座日后将会成为首都的小城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他在破落的城门前跪下，不住地哀哭。那座城市就从哭声中得到了新的名字，佩尔多尼朵拉，“宽恕已去”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，当时的人们需要的不是哀悼，而是抚慰。许多人更习惯将那个名字简称为佩尔多尼——“宽恕”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，黄金时代的遗产，最后的伊比利亚之眼重新亮起，艾丽妮，这意味着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望和决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“希望和决心”，当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人，你回答我时的眼神要比达里奥年轻时更加坚毅，这很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这种鼓舞人心的发言往往并不是最准确的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半个世纪后，我们一再后撤的防线终于重新向前推进至此。很快，这里将会成为审判庭新的中枢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可与此同时，我们也将一切袒露在了海洋——海嗣，还有阿戈尔——面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚已捉襟见肘。这个国家无法再掩藏它长久以来的疲弱和困病，这是不争的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一个事实是，我们已不可能再次退却。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师——欸，艾丽妮阁下，好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一身还挺适合你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢、谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊对了，紧急情况——灯塔刚刚监测到了一批来历不明的信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信号来源似乎不是海底，而是天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，我想它已经肉眼可见了......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡门和艾丽妮紧紧盯着远处的天空。年轻的书记顺着两人的视线看过去。\n他愣在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i01_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们看见了飞翔的鳞群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"仿生无人机。早年岛民带上岸的器物里，曾有过类似的造物。"},{"type":"narration","text":"无人机矩阵眨眼间便已越过海面，与高耸的大灯塔遥相对应。其中一只脱离编队，缓缓悬停在三人的面前。\n机翼如鳍翕动，光的微粒在虚空中舞蹈，亲切而富有磁性的女声旋即响起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i01_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（伊比利亚语）伊比利亚的诸位，请不必紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是来自阿戈尔的致意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是本国社会行政监察所的技术执政官之一，克莱门莎。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡门端举提灯，平静地直视着身前的无人机。\n两种截然不同的光亮，仿佛两个截然不同的文明的对话——或者对峙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚审判庭，圣徒卡门·伊·伊比利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，这应当是我们两国之间的首次正式交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是这样没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您的伊比利亚语很标准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"离开本境前，我为自己录入过伊比利亚的语言模块。如果我的表达有不得当的地方，还请您理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此外，也请原谅我暂时只能以这种形式与您沟通，伊比利亚......阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们对这种形式的交流没有异议，但我对它发生得如此之迟感到遗憾，执政官阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被你们称为“航道”的计划据称已经进行到后半，而近在咫尺的伊比利亚仍对种种细节一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们将迎接伊比利亚的使节前往我们的城市，阿戈尔尊重伊比利亚在被海嗣危机波及时所做出的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“波及”——伊比利亚所面对的，只是危机的余波？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不必纠结外交辞令，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们都认同语言的力量。而您的姓名，卡门·伊·伊比利亚，本身便已是一种象征，勇气与魄力的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以阿戈尔才会来此。我们希望达成与伊比利亚、与陆上诸国的合作，开辟一条直抵陆地的航道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们将净空从阿戈尔本境到陆地之间的大片海域，以便阿戈尔的主力抵达海岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我想我不必提醒您，将大量军队派遣至其他国家的边境，这种行为在陆上意味着什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"意味着为了对抗即将到来的巨大威胁，我们将竭尽所能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，我愿意前往陆地与您会晤，向您详细解释一切。但来到深海，会方便诸位更好地理解我们当下的处境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第八与第十军团的舰队正在有序清剿沿途海嗣。他们随后将迎接诸位前往我们的城市，弥利亚留姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无人机编队将持续向诸位同步战斗进程与环境变化，直到诸位安全抵达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海洋或许正在酝酿一场前所未有的灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而审判官阁下，我忧心大地即使再浩瀚，也不过是另一座孤岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"narration","text":"无人机矩阵收敛了辉光，这场突如其来的通讯已经结束。\n海风依旧在吹，老人缓缓放下了手中的提灯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“直抵陆地的航道”——她的表达很得体，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔无疑是傲慢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个手持利器的傲慢的大人，不屑于对赤手空拳的孩子耍弄心机与手腕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，将刚刚的通讯内容同步给我们的合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希已经同意作为伊比利亚的使节出访阿戈尔，一直对航道计划心存疑虑的深海猎人此时应该也已经做出了决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会尽快与格兰法洛的其他审判官将事务交接清楚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，刚才与阿戈尔通讯的全部内容，我都做了记录，请您过目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您是否批准我前往......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书记，一周前你就已经提交了申请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，既然现在阿戈尔的舰队马上就要来了，我想，是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果已经做了决定，犹豫反而会让你的表态没有说服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很小的时候，蒂亚戈叔叔就总是忧心忡忡的。他跟我说：“乔迪，你应该离开格兰法洛，离开伊比利亚。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他没法告诉我，我该去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔，那是我的家乡，我的家乡在大海里，而大海无法靠近。我从没听过阿戈尔的声音，也从没看过阿戈尔的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，它很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭同意你的申请，乔迪·方塔纳罗萨。你将作为伊比利亚的使节，与艾丽妮和凯尔希一同前往阿戈尔的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。这并不是一次奖励，你在审判庭的工作做得算不上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"选择艾丽妮，是因为她已经做好了准备，甚至为此抛弃了自己坚持许久的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而选择你，恰恰是因为你仍然困惑和怅然，软弱终究会腐蚀你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加入审判庭是一次考验，回到自己的家乡，同样也是一次考验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白的，老师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里已经是海沟的最深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们掏空了海沟两侧的峭壁，向内筑巢。所以我们绕了好几圈，都没有发现这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也闻到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种气味......海嗣在摧毁了原有的海洋生态之后，又创建了一套完全只为它们自己服务的生态系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此完善的海嗣生态系统，原本只存在于海洋的深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，罗辛南特。接下来我一个人进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不悦地晃动脖颈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整块大陆架都在变化，我需要知道，究竟是谁在使海浪鼓噪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉骑士，别停止狩猎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是暂时分别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌尔比安游进了巢穴。\n他没有选择潜行，因为发光的植物海嗣点亮了巢穴的每一个角落，他无处可藏。\n在盘旋而上的厚实叶片之间，造型奇特的微小生物在酣眠或游弋。\n海床原本的岩石已不可见。溟痕缓缓摇动着细小的触肢，捕捉着有机物的碎屑，它们织成层层叠叠的菌毯，淹没了乌尔比安游动的声响。\n他清晰地感受到自己身体的变化。意识在舒展，躯壳在放松，体内的每一个细胞都在试图回应着什么。\n他分明是闯入这里的异类，可整个巢穴都在向自己盛开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ul......Ul-pian......咕......Ul-pianus，同胞。"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌尔比安几乎能看穿海嗣接近透明的躯体，他在等待对方吐出捕食或者被他捕食之类的蠢话，但是并没有。\n海嗣，在思考他的思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于。你走过长路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里。营养足够。褪去累赘的血肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回归。滋长。迁徙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我为你而生，Ul-pianus，只为你而生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我解开你。疑惑。我引导你。回归族群怀抱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们因何迁徙？你们要去向何方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ul-pianus，你仍动摇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，你需要知晓大群。你想要知晓大群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生代即将苏醒。生代需要回归。新的循环。建构海洋。离开海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生代苏醒？离开海洋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大群。看见。新的长路。我们尽快——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，那座城市在进行的事情，与你们有什么关联？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
